FUNC ID LPAREN ID COLON INT RPAREN COLON INT LBRACE
IF LPAREN ID LE INT_LIT RPAREN LBRACE
RETURN INT_LIT SEMICOLON
RBRACE
RETURN ID STAR ID LPAREN ID MINUS INT_LIT RPAREN SEMICOLON
RBRACE
VAR ID COLON INT SEMICOLON
PRINT LPAREN STRING_LIT RPAREN SEMICOLON
INPUT LPAREN ID RPAREN SEMICOLON
FOR LPAREN VAR ID COLON INT ASSIGN INT_LIT SEMICOLON ID LE ID SEMICOLON ID ASSIGN ID PLUS INT_LIT RPAREN LBRACE
PRINT LPAREN STRING_LIT PLUS ID PLUS STRING_LIT PLUS ID LPAREN ID RPAREN RPAREN SEMICOLON
RBRACE
EOF
